{"id":"eifersucht","lemma":"Eifersucht","pos":"noun","rank":3592,"glosses":["jealousy"],"ipa":"/ˈʔaɪ̯fɐzʊxt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c0/De-Eifersucht.ogg/De-Eifersucht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Eifersucht"},"examples":[{"text":"Es war ein Verbrechen aus Eifersucht.","en":"It was a crime of passion.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"a felony"},{"g":"out of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann ihre Eifersucht nicht ertragen.","en":"I can't stand her jealousy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Die Eifersucht brannte in ihr.","en":"She was burning with jealousy.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to burn","l":"brennen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"}]},{"text":"Ich neige nicht zur Eifersucht.","en":"I'm not the jealous type.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to incline","l":"neigen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Das Mordmotiv war Eifersucht.","en":"Jealousy was the motive for the murder.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]}]}